      "writtenOn": "2022-01-26T01:31:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Connor, does -g add *too* much debug info?\n\nWould the benefit of having a \u0027btf: true\u0027 be that we could -g, but then strip out some of the extraneous stuff?\n\nOr have some other way to get map annotations without 4x .o bloat?",
      "revId": "c707b7229f83655a98fc267e2fa33b09cf55d28b",
