      "writtenOn": "2022-01-26T01:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, originally I was hesitant to have the btf option automatically strip (vs adding a separate \"strip:\" option) because stripping affects backward compatibility - it reorders the sections in a way that is going to require a patch to bpfloader to handle properly, therefore can\u0027t use it in mainline programs. I think that concern is moot now since old versions of bpfloader without https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/system/bpf/+/1954096 can\u0027t load BTF-enabled programs properly anyway.\n\nNeed to revisit the correct settings for how much to strip out, then will upload a new version of this that strips out the extraneous sections.",
      "parentUuid": "b35f6faf_e0fa375d",
      "revId": "c707b7229f83655a98fc267e2fa33b09cf55d28b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
